0..67 Comment "// Including an imported theory: a theory is a named presentation a"
68..144 Comment "// client imports, so `include` names a block of a source its source imports"
145..222 Comment "// unqualified as it names one of its own. The imported monoid is extended by"
223..299 Comment "// a chosen element; a model of the extension gives the monoid\'s members and"
300..325 Comment "// the element, and runs."
